lities</h4>\n              <p class=\"mt-2 text-base text-gray-600 brown:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed\">Delegates will be inspired to turn resource limitations into opportunities, showcasing Africa’s ingenuity.</p>\n              <div class=\"mt-6 rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-gray-100 brown:bg-white/5 brown:ring-white/10\">\n                <p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 brown:text-primary-200 italic leading-snug\">\n                  “Yes, Africa Can (collective action) – No Human is Limited (individual excellence)” is not just a slogan but a lived reality.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n{% component \"speakers\"%}\n\n\n    <section id=\"schedule\" class=\"bg-gray-50 py-20 brown:bg-gray-900 lg:py-28\">\n      <style>\n        .conference-schedule-table {\n          min-width: 1028px;\n          border-collapse: collapse;\n          border-top: 2px solid #1f2937;\n          color: #333333;\n          table-layout: fixed;\n        }\n\n        .conference-schedule-table th,\n        .conference-schedule-table td {\n          border: 1px solid #d9dee6;\n          padding: 12px 18px;\n          text-align: center;\n          vertical-align: middle;\n          font-size: 15px;\n          line-height: 1.25;\n        }\n\n        .conference-schedule-table thead th {\n          background: #dfe8f2;\n          color: #151922;\n          font-weight: 500;\n        }\n\n        .conference-schedule-table .time-column {\n          width: 258px;\n          font-weight: 500;\n        }\n\n        .conference-schedule-table .room-column {\n          width: 257px;\n        }\n\n        .conference-schedule-table tbody td {\n          background: #ffffff;\n          height: 44px;\n        }\n\n        .conference-schedule-table .time-slot {\n          color: #333333;\n          font-weight: 400;\n          white-space: nowrap;\n        }\n\n        .conference-schedule-table .session-strong {\n          font-weight: 700;\n        }\n\n        .conference-schedule-table .empty-cell {\n          background: #ffffff;\n        }\n\n        .conference-schedule-wrap {\n          -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n        }\n\n        .conference-mobile-schedule {\n          display: none;\n        }\n\n        .brown .conference-schedule-table {\n          border-top-color: #cbd5e1;\n          color: #e5e7eb;\n        }\n\n        .brown .conference-schedule-table th,\n        .brown .conference-schedule-table td {\n          border-color: #334155;\n        }\n\n        .brown .conference-schedule-table thead th {\n          background: #243244;\n          color: #f8fafc;\n        }\n\n        .brown .conference-schedule-table tbody td,\n        .brown .conference-schedule-table .empty-cell {\n          background: #111827;\n        }\n\n        .brown .conference-schedule-table .time-slot {\n          color: #e5e7eb;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 767px) {\n          .conference-schedule-wrap {\n            display: none;\n          }\n\n          .conference-mobile-schedule {\n            display: grid;\n            gap: 12px;\n          }\n\n          .conference-mobile-day {\n            border: 1px solid #d9dee6;\n            background: #dfe8f2;\n            padding: 14px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: #151922;\n          }\n\n          .conference-mobile-slot {\n            overflow: hidden;\n            border: 1px solid #d9dee6;\n            background: #ffffff;\n          }\n\n          .conference-mobile-time {\n            background: #dfe8f2;\n            padding: 10px 14px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: #151922;\n          }\n\n          .conference-mobile-room {\n            border-top: 1px solid #d9dee6;\n            padding: 12px 14px;\n          }\n\n          .conference-mobile-room span {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            letter-spacing: 0;\n            color: #64748b;\n          }\n\n          .conference-mobile-room p {\n            margin: 0;\n            overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            line-height: 1.35;\n            color: #333333;\n          }\n\n          .conference-mobile-room .session-strong {\n            font-weight: 700;\n          }\n\n          .brown .conference-mobile-day,\n          .brown .conference-mobile-time {\n            border-color: #334155;\n            background: #243244;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n          }\n\n          .brown .conference-mobile-slot {\n            border-color: #334155;\n            background: #111827;\n          }\n\n          .brown .conference-mobile-room {\n            border-color: #334155;\n          }\n\n          .brown .conference-mobile-room span {\n            color: #94a3b8;\n          }\n\n          .brown .conference-mobile-room p {\n            color: #e5e7eb;\n          }\n\n          .conference-schedule-table {\n            min-width: 720px;\n          }\n\n          .conference-schedule-table th,\n          .conference-schedule-table td {\n            padding: 10px 8px;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            line-height: 1.25;\n          }\n\n          .conference-schedule-table .time-column,\n          .conference-schedule-table .time-slot {\n            position: sticky;\n            left: 0;\n            z-index: 2;\n            width: 132px;\n            min-width: 132px;\n            box-shadow: 1px 0 0 #d9dee6;\n          }\n\n          .conference-schedule-table .time-column {\n            z-index: 3;\n          }\n\n          .conference-schedule-table .room-column {\n            width: 196px;\n          }\n\n          .conference-schedule-table tbody td {\n            height: 42px;\n          }\n\n          .brown .conference-schedule-table .time-column,\n          .brown .conference-schedule-table .time-slot {\n            box-shadow: 1px 0 0 #334155;\n          }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 420px) {\n          .conference-schedule-table {\n            min-width: 660px;\n          }\n\n          .conference-schedule-table th,\n          .conference-schedule-table td {\n            padding: 9px 6px;\n            font-size: 11px;\n          }\n\n          .conference-schedule-table .time-column,\n          .conference-schedule-table .time-slot {\n            width: 112px;\n            min-width: 112px;\n          }\n\n          .conference-schedule-table .room-column {\n            width: 182px;\n          }\n        }\n      </style>\n      <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 lg:px-8\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\">\n          <div\n            class=\"mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-accent-200 bg-accent-50 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-accent-700 brown:border-accent-800 brown:bg-accent-900/30 brown:text-accent-300\">\n            Day 1 Programme\n          </div>\n          <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 brown:text-white sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\">\n            Event <span class=\"text-gradient\">Schedule</span> </h2>\n          <p class=\"mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600 brown:text-gray-400\">\n            A room-by-room view of sessions, breaks, and shared events throughout the conference day.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"conference-schedule-wrap mt-12 overflow-x-auto rounded-sm border border-gray-200 bg-white shadow-sm brown:border-gray-700 brown:bg-gray-800\" data-animate>\n          <table class=\"conference-schedule-table w-full\" aria-label=\"Day 1 conference schedule\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th rowspan=\"3\" scope=\"col\" class=\"time-column\">Time &amp; Venue</th>\n                <th colspan=\"3\" scope=\"colgroup\">Day 1 (Sep. 9)</th>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <th scope=\"col\" class=\"room-column\">Main Room (500 seats)</th>\n                <th scope=\"col\" class=\"room-column\">Session Room 1 (150 seats)</th>\n                <th scope=\"col\" class=\"room-column\">Session Room 2 (150 seats)</th>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <th scope=\"col\" class=\"room-column\">Radiation Therapy (Photon RT &amp; AI)</th>\n                <th scope=\"col\" class=\"room-column\">Brachytherapy &amp; Radiation Protection</th>\n                <th scope=\"col\" class=\"room-column\">Plan Challenge / FLASH &amp; AI Education</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"time-slot\">08:00 - 09:00</td>\n                <td colspan=\"3\">Registration</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"time-slot\">09:00 - 09:30</td>\n                <td colspan=\"3\" rowspan=\"2\" class=\"session-strong\">Opening - AFOMP / KSMP<br>(09:00 - 09:50)</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"time-slot\">09:30 - 10:00</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"time-slot\">10:00 - 10:30</td>\n                <td colspan=\"2\">Keynote Address 1 (Radiation Therapy + AI)<br>(10:00 - 10:40)</td>\n                <td rowspan=\"3\">Plan Challenge Awards</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"time-slot\">10:30 - 11:00</td>\n                <td colspan=\"2\" class=\"session-strong\">Exhibition Booth Tour &amp; Coffee Break</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"time-slot\">11:00 - 11:30</td>\n                <td>Invited Talk RT1</td>\n                <td>Invited Talk BT1</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"time-slot\">11:30 - 12:00</td>\n                <td>Invited Talk RT2</td>\n                <td>Invited Talk BT2</td>\n                <td class=\"session-strong\">Coffee Break</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"time-slot\">12:00 - 12:30</td>\n                <td class=\"session-strong\">Luncheon Symposium 1-1<br>(12:00 - 12:40)</td>\n                <td class=\"session-strong\">Luncheon Symposium 1-2<br>(12:00 - 12:40)</td>\n                <td class=\"session-strong\">Luncheon Symposium<br>(12:00 - 12:40)</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"time-slot\">12:30 - 13:00</td>\n                <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"session-strong\">Exhibition Booth Tour</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"time-slot\">13:00 - 13:30</td>\n                <td>Invited Talk RT3</td>\n                <td>Invited Talk RP1</td>\n                <td rowspan=\"4\">Proton and Electron FLASH<br>Lecture</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"time-slot\">13:30 - 14:00</td>\n                <td>Invited Talk RT4</td>\n                <td>Invited Talk RP2</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"time-slot\">14:00 - 14:30</td>\n                <td colspan=\"2\" class=\"session-strong\">Young Investigator Competition (at Kiosk) / Exhibition Booth Tour &amp;<br>Coffee Break</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"time-slot\">14:30 - 15:00</td>\n                <td>Oral Presentation (Selected<br>abstract)</td>\n                <td>Oral Presentation (Selected<br>abstract)</td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"conference-mobile-schedule mt-10\" aria-label=\"Day 1 conference schedule for small screens\">\n          <div class=\"conference-mobile-day\">Day 1 (Sep. 9)</div>\n\n          <div class=\"conference-mobile-slot\">\n            <div class=\"conference-mobile-time\">08:00 -