(38, 'debug', 'From: Nuclear Conference <noreply@octobercms.tld>\r\nTo: Calvin Boore <calmajos@gmail.com>\r\nSubject: AFRIRPA 2027 Submission Received\r\nMIME-Version: 1.0\r\nDate: Wed, 06 May 2026 13:07:21 +0000\r\nMessage-ID: <3a6c698733b7124e065b73871babee07@octobercms.tld>\r\nContent-Type: multipart/alternative; boundary=bh38h8iT\r\n\r\n--bh38h8iT\r\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\r\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\r\n\r\n<p>Dear Calvin Boore,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you for submitting your abstract \"<=\r\nstrong>Radiation on planet earth.</strong>\" to AFRIRPA 2027. We have succes=\r\nsfully received your submission and it is now under review.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><st=\r\nrong>Submission Details:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Title:</stro=\r\nng> Radiation on planet earth.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Category:</strong> Br=\r\nachytherapy</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Presentation Type:</strong> Oral Present=\r\nation</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Submitted:</strong> May 6, 2026 13:07</li>\r\n<=\r\n/ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Edit Your Submission</strong></p>\r\n<p>You can make ch=\r\nanges to your abstract until the submission deadline using the secure link =\r\nbelow:</p>\r\n<p><a href=3D\"http://127.0.0.1:8000/submission/edit/iCQvZtLulL=\r\npFrfoPLVIntesrDhhkkBEZHfAgcXIjznNFhY60jNQZMTEZ8KHtnyFR\">http://127.0.0.1:80=\r\n00/submission/edit/iCQvZtLulLpFrfoPLVIntesrDhhkkBEZHfAgcXIjznNFhY60jNQZMTEZ=\r\n8KHtnyFR</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Your Edit Password:</strong> <code style=\r\n=3D\"background: #f0f0f0; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 1=\r\n4px;\">V0NORUXQPX</code></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Note: This link will expire on <str=\r\nong>June 5, 2026 13:07</strong>. After that, you will not be able to edit y=\r\nour submission.</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you did not make this submission, pleas=\r\ne contact us immediately at <a href=3D\"mailto:support@afrirpa.org\">support@=\r\nafrirpa.org</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Best regards,<br>\r\nAFRIRPA 2027 Organizing Co=\r\n