(66, 'debug', 'From: Nuclear Conference <noreply@octobercms.tld>\r\nTo: Calvin Boore <calmajos@gmail.com>\r\nSubject: Your AFRIRPA 2027 submission was accepted\r\nMIME-Version: 1.0\r\nDate: Wed, 06 May 2026 15:45:09 +0000\r\nMessage-ID: <8b59582ec3dc7dc5c178f1edaf38026b@octobercms.tld>\r\nContent-Type: multipart/alternative; boundary=TsOSl8y4\r\n\r\n--TsOSl8y4\r\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\r\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\r\n\r\n<p>Dear Calvin Boore,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We are pleased to inform you that your ab=\r\nstract submission to AFRIRPA 2027 has been <strong>accepted</strong>.</p>=\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Submission Details:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>=\r\nTitle:</strong> Radiation on planet earth.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Category:=\r\n</strong> Brachytherapy</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Decision:</strong> <span cla=\r\nss=3D\"decision-accepted\">Accepted</span></li>\r\n    <li><strong>Decided On:=\r\n</strong> May 6, 2026</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n    <p>Congratulations! We look for=\r\nward to your presentation at AFRIRPA 2027. Please check the conference webs=\r\nite for further instructions regarding registration, accommodation, and pre=\r\nsentation guidelines.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you have any questions, please contact=\r\n the organizing committee at <a href=3D\"mailto:support@afrirpa.org\">support=\r\n@afrirpa.org</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Best regards,<br>\r\nAFRIRPA 2027 Organizing C=\r\nommittee</p>\r\n--TsOSl8y4\r\nContent-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8\r\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.=\r\nw3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\r\n<html xmlns=3D\"http://www.=\r\nw3.org/1999/xhtml\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta name=3D\"viewport\" content=3D\"width=\r\n=3Ddevice-width, initial-scale=3D1.0\">\r\n    <meta http-equiv=3D\"Content-Ty=\r\npe\" content=3D\"text/html; charset=3DUTF-8\">\r\n</head>\r\n<body style=3D\"box-=\r\nsizing: border-bo